      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Steps to reproduce this internally:\n\n1. Join ~79 VRC+ users to an instance\n\n2. Join 1 non-VRC user to the instance\n\n3. Gift drop 1x VRC+ repeatedly from a VRC+ user in the instance prioritizing non-VRC users, say, 100 times and check who gets the most gifts\n\nIf my assumption is correct, the 1 non-VRC user will get the most gifts in this scenario.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
