  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2026-06-02T05:06:49.922Z",
  "deleteID": null,
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Over the several hours in VRChat Official Pride Hub Music Event, (bot) users without an active VRC+ subscription or gifts (such as MapleAI and CelesteAI) seemed to receive an disproportionate amount of VRC+ gifts over the course of the event compared to the rest of the event population. The bots had no active VRC+ at the time the bot accounts joined the instance, and those accounts staid for several hours in the instance. | OPERATOR | reportedly said CelesteAI received 8 months of VRC+ during the event.\n\nVRC+ gift drops default to an option of prioritizing gifting VRC+ for those without an active VRC+ subscription.\n\nThis could be RNG / selection bias. There may be a bug where the VRC+ subscription status is not updated within an instance after a non-VRC+ user receives a VRC+ gift, making that user count as a non-VRC+ user (or bot) for gifting as long as the user/bot stays within the instance and gifts keep dropping.",
